Package: spotifypulse
Title: Spotify Pulse - Interactive Explorer of 30k+ Spotify Tracks
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Benediktas", "Poviliunas", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "benukomailas@gmail.com")
Description: A production-style Shiny dashboard exploring the audio landscape
    of 30,000+ Spotify tracks. Built with bslib, data.table, ggiraph, plotly
    and DT; tested with testthat and shinytest2. This DESCRIPTION exists to
    declare dependencies for CI and tooling - the repository is a Shiny app,
    not an installable package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    bslib (>= 0.6.0),
    data.table (>= 1.14.0),
    DT,
    ggiraph,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    plotly,
    shiny (>= 1.8.0)
Suggests:
    shinytest2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
